Description:It is your second main phase. You control Kokusho, the Evening Star and have Spark Double (enter as a copy of a creature you control, except with a +1/+1 counter and not legendary) and Fling in hand, with four blue and two red mana floating. The opponent is at 11 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-copy-exception-nonlegendary | A copy effect's exceptions become part of the copiable values (CR 707.9b): Spark Double becomes a nonlegendary 6/6 Kokusho, so no legend rule applies; Fling it for 6 and its own dies trigger drains 5; Flinging the original Kokusho deals 5 + 5 = 10
